  "instructions": [
    "heat peanut oil in a small pan over medium heat.",
    "add garlic and cook for 1 minute until fragrant.",
    "add dill pickle relish and cook for another minute until heated through.",
    "add hot sauce and stir to combine.",
    "add peanuts and stir-fry for 2 minutes until toasted.",
    "add chopped cilantro, mayonnaise, and grated ginger. stir to combine.",
    "warm ti-leaf wrap in the microwave for 10 seconds.",
